  "contentHtml": "<p>정현주 선생님께서 도블 카드를 올려주신 것을 보고 정말 좋았습니다 !!</p><p>저는 감각 기관이 끝나서&#160;너무 아쉬웠습니다.</p><p>삘 꽂혀서 주말 동안 만들어보았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d0c1c718b6aa799ee4f1672ec2a6b2deb93fc4e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"426\" height=\"306\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8d0c1c718b6aa799ee4f1672ec2a6b2deb93fc4e\" data-origin-width=\"767\" data-origin-height=\"551\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: #9feec3;\"><b>파일 1) <b>도블 규칙</b></b></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: #9feec3;\"><b>파일 2) <b>카드 31개 사전 연습</b></b></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: #9feec3;\"><b>파일 3) <b>한 카드에 그림 6개씩있는 도블 카드 31장입니다.</b></b></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: #9feec3;\"><b>파일 4) <b><b>한 카드에 그림 4개씩있는 도블 카드 13장입니다.</b></b></b></span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3956d1c925cdc17939c73d097806817ca827c17c?download\" data-file-name=\"도블 게임 규칙.hwp\" data-file-size=\"3367936\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1300%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20220504213507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3956d1c925cdc17939c73d097806817ca827c17c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블 게임 규칙</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.21MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/efa7a91a2810ec739a041205904f039a41e9b1cf?download\" data-file-name=\"도블기초연습_활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1432576\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1300%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20220504213507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fefa7a91a2810ec739a041205904f039a41e9b1cf')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블기초연습_활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.37MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/483334fff27a7b1af8a7149a9f17628a96c15121?download\" data-file-name=\"도블이미지jpg - 여백31개.zip\" data-file-size=\"4023950\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-zip-compressed\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1300%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20220504213507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F483334fff27a7b1af8a7149a9f17628a96c15121')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블이미지jpg - 여백31개</span><span class=\"type\">.zip</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.84MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf72afece816ee02ce6c99c2bba666debe4021df?download\" data-file-name=\"도블이미지jpg - 여백13개.zip\" data-file-size=\"1229580\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-zip-compressed\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1300%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20220504213507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fcf72afece816ee02ce6c99c2bba666debe4021df')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도블이미지jpg - 여백13개</span><span class=\"type\">.zip</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.17MB</div></div></a></div><p>유전자, 염색체 파트를 나가면서</p><p>용어는 너무 어려운데 항상 용어는 약속이니 외우라고 주입하여서</p><p>저도 애들도 너무 괴로웠는데 도블을 알려주셔서 만들어보았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그런데 범위가 좁아서 그림 31개를 채우기 어려워서</p><p>그림이 다른 동일한 용어가 많이 나옵니다.</p><p>그림이 달라지면 용어가 초면인 듯,</p><p>못 찾는 아이들에게 연습시킨다고 생각하고 중복으로 만들었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>+) 저는 알려주신 사이트에서 만들었는데 카드마다 원의 크기가 조금 달랐어요...!</p><p>혹시 크기가 다른 것이 신경쓰시는 선생님께서는</p><p>압축 파일에 있는 이미지 파일을 활용해서 새로 만드시거나</p><p>네모로 자르시면 좋을 것 같아요 ...!!</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfft3miea39pfjcifz1kxxv9@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"450\" data-video-height=\"253\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvfft3miea39pfjcifz1kxxv9/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33208576297&amp;signature=8onVAHZjQXBGnua1HEoH5Yr2WSY%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfft3miea39pfjcifz1kxxv9?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZmZ0M21pZWEzOXBmamNpZnoxa3h4djkiLCJ0aWQiOiI0ZDQ4NjVlZC02YjU1LTQ3Y2QtYTkwNy0zNTRmMWFjMWEwMDciLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQxOTZ9.4oHLw_lwWj3gJVOs9YIpPFwJLVauIVvr6IlVZd4NF8PRsWRfSrvYZzaAmhAkqE9HbCKraqHsDu6YTC4pt-ELPA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"450\" height=\"253\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>직접 해보니 (초성이 있어서 그런지) 처음 배우는 용어도 곧 잘 합니다.</p><p>다만 초성을 가리니 머뭇...하거나 틀리지만</p><p>용어를 입에 익히기엔 좋은 것 같습니다.</p><p>저는 도블을 처음 알았지만 아이들은 도블을 이미 알고 있어서</p><p>규칙을 설명하느라 시간 뺏기지 않아서 좋았습니다.</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><p>+) 혹시 필요하신 분들을 위해 도블 만드는 사이트 이용 방법을 올려볼게요 !!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/826bed816859768b9cad798537c03e81747509dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/826bed816859768b9cad798537c03e81747509dd\" data-origin-width=\"817\" data-origin-height=\"733\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4be3a2ec7ae14e751d5dd0cc10234a0eae77b15\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4be3a2ec7ae14e751d5dd0cc10234a0eae77b15\" data-origin-width=\"796\" data-origin-height=\"379\"></div><p><span><b>2. 도블 만들어주는 사이트</b></span></p><p><span><a href=\"http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">http://aaronbarker.net/spot-it/spot-it.html#d</a></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa0a344459d76a7c0cd70b1b027ef3d22275baae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aa0a344459d76a7c0cd70b1b027ef3d22275baae\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"650\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d7d5587310cefd941326c8900691814ecf84bc5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d7d5587310cefd941326c8900691814ecf84bc5\" data-origin-width=\"787\" data-origin-height=\"598\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07fd66ce9009a959dbccd36159ef5b1277d84346\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07fd66ce9009a959dbccd36159ef5b1277d84346\" data-origin-width=\"792\" data-origin-height=\"693\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
